const escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1 = (value: unknown): string => String(value ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, character => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#39;' }[character] || character));
const atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1 = <T extends object>(value: unknown): T[] => Array.isArray(value) ? value.filter((item): item is T => Boolean(item && typeof item === 'object' && !Array.isArray(item))) : [];
const atlasStageAdministrationTextV1 = (value: unknown, fallback = '—'): string => String(value ?? '').trim() || fallback;
const atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1 = (cents: unknown): string => new Intl.NumberFormat('pt-BR', { style: 'currency', currency: 'BRL' }).format((Number(cents) || 0) / 100);
const atlasStageAdministrationNumberV1 = (value: unknown): string => new Intl.NumberFormat('pt-BR', { maximumFractionDigits: 2 }).format(Number(value) || 0);

function renderAtlasStageAdministrationContentV1(data: AtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceModelV1, tab: AtlasStageAdministrationTabV1): string {
  const esc = escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1;
  const empty = (columns: number, label: string): string => `<tr><td colspan="${columns}" class="stage-admin-empty">${esc(label)}</td></tr>`;
  const activities = atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationActivityRowV1>(data.activities);
  const purchases = atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationPurchaseRowV1>(data.purchases);
  const materials = atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationMaterialRowV1>(data.materials);
  const services = atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationServiceRowV1>(data.outsourcing);
  const records = atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationFieldRecordV1>(data.records);
  if (tab === 'activities') return `<div class="stage-admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${atlasStageAdministrationHeadersV1('activities')}</tr></thead><tbody>${activities.map(item => `<tr><td><b>${esc(item.name)}</b></td><td>${esc(item.category || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.status || '—')}</td><td>${Number(item.progress) || 0}%</td><td>${esc(item.ownerId || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.plannedStart || '—')} → ${esc(item.plannedEnd || '—')}</td></tr>`).join('') || empty(6, atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.activities)}</tbody></table></div>`;
  if (tab === 'purchases') return `<div class="stage-admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${atlasStageAdministrationHeadersV1('purchases')}</tr></thead><tbody>${purchases.map(item => `<tr><td><code>${esc(item.id)}</code></td><td>${esc(item.supplier)}</td><td>${esc(item.description)}</td><td>${atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1(item.valueCents)}</td><td>${esc(item.status)}</td><td>${esc(item.expectedDate || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.delay || '—')}</td></tr>`).join('') || empty(7, atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.purchases)}</tbody></table></div><section class="stage-admin-secondary-list"><h4>Comprovantes de compras</h4>${atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationReceiptV1>(data.receipts).map(item => `<article><div><b>${esc(item.supplier || 'Fornecedor')}</b><span>${esc(item.documentNumber || 'Sem número')} · ${esc(item.issueDate || 'sem data')}</span></div><strong>${atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1(item.amountCents)}</strong><small>${esc(item.fileName || item.notes || 'Comprovante')}</small></article>`).join('') || `<p class="stage-admin-empty">${esc(atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.receipts)}</p>`}</section>`;
  if (tab === 'materials') return `<div class="stage-admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${atlasStageAdministrationHeadersV1('materials')}</tr></thead><tbody>${materials.map(item => `<tr><td><b>${esc(item.name)}</b><small>${esc(item.unit || '')}</small></td><td>${atlasStageAdministrationNumberV1(item.plannedQuantity)}</td><td>${atlasStageAdministrationNumberV1(item.receivedQuantity)}</td><td>${atlasStageAdministrationNumberV1(item.usedQuantity)}</td><td>${atlasStageAdministrationNumberV1((Number(item.receivedQuantity) || 0) - (Number(item.usedQuantity) || 0))}</td><td>${esc(item.status || '—')}</td></tr>`).join('') || empty(6, atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.materials)}</tbody></table></div>`;
  if (tab === 'services') return `<div class="stage-admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${atlasStageAdministrationHeadersV1('services')}</tr></thead><tbody>${services.map(item => `<tr><td><b>${esc(item.contractor)}</b></td><td>${esc(item.service)}</td><td>${atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1(item.amountCents)}</td><td>${esc(item.issueDate || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.documentNumber || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.notes || '—')}</td></tr>`).join('') || empty(6, atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.services)}</tbody></table></div>`;
  if (tab === 'records') return `<div class="stage-admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${atlasStageAdministrationHeadersV1('records')}</tr></thead><tbody>${records.map(item => `<tr><td><code>${esc(item.id)}</code></td><td>${esc(item.data || '—')} ${esc(item.hora || '')}</td><td>${esc(item.responsavel || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.detalhes || '—')}</td><td>${esc(item.status || '—')}</td></tr>`).join('') || empty(5, atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.records)}</tbody></table></div>`;
  if (tab === 'history') return `<div class="stage-admin-history">${atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationAuditEventV1>(data.auditEvents).map(item => {
    const payload = item.payload && typeof item.payload === 'object' ? item.payload as Record<string, unknown> : {};
    const summary = Object.entries(payload).filter(([, value]) => ['string', 'number', 'boolean'].includes(typeof value)).slice(0, 5).map(([key, value]) => `${key}: ${value}`).join(' · ') || 'Alteração registrada.';
    const created = item.createdAt ? new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR') : '—';
    return `<article><time>${esc(created)}</time><div><b>${esc(item.entity)} · ${esc(item.action)}</b><span>${esc(item.entityId || '')}</span><p>${esc(summary)}</p></div></article>`;
  }).join('') || `<p class="stage-admin-empty">${esc(atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.emptyStates.history)}</p>`}</div>`;

  const situation = data.situation && typeof data.situation === 'object' ? data.situation : {};
  const activitySummary = situation.activities || {};
  const purchaseSummary = situation.purchases || {};
  const materialSummary = situation.materials || {};
  const serviceSummary = situation.services || {};
  const evidenceSummary = situation.evidence || {};
  const cashSummary = situation.cash || {};
  const summary = data.summary || {};
  const ai = data.aiConfig || {};
  const kpis = [
    [atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.activities.label, activitySummary.total ?? activities.length, `${activitySummary.averageProgress ?? 0}% de ${atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.activities.note}`],
    [atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.purchases.label, atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1(purchaseSummary.valueCents ?? summary.purchaseTotalCents), `${purchaseSummary.late ?? 0} ${atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.purchases.note}`],
    [atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.materials.label, materialSummary.total ?? materials.length, `${materialSummary.critical ?? 0} ${atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.materials.note}`],
    [atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.services.label, serviceSummary.total ?? services.length, atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1(serviceSummary.valueCents || 0)],
    [atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.evidence.label, (evidenceSummary.records ?? records.length) + (evidenceSummary.receipts ?? atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<AtlasStageAdministrationReceiptV1>(data.receipts).length), atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.evidence.note],
    [atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.cash.label, atlasStageAdministrationMoneyV1(cashSummary.balanceCents ?? ((Number(summary.cashInCents) || 0) - (Number(summary.cashOutCents) || 0))), atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.kpis.cash.note],
  ];
  const metadata = `<form data-stage-admin-meta class="stage-admin-meta-form"><header><div><span>PROPRIEDADES DA ETAPA</span><h4>Administração da frente</h4></div><small>Atualização auditável</small></header><label>Nome<input name="name" value="${esc(data.name)}"></label><label>Responsável<input name="owner" value="${esc(data.owner)}"></label><label>Status<select name="status">${atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.stageStatuses.map(({ value, label }) => `<option value="${esc(value)}" ${String(data.status).toLowerCase() === value ? 'selected' : ''}>${esc(label)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Avanço (%)<input name="progress" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="${Number(data.progress) || 0}"></label><label>Semana / referência<input name="week" value="${esc(data.week || '')}"></label><footer><span data-stage-admin-meta-status>Alterações alimentam o histórico da etapa.</span><button type="submit">Salvar propriedades</button></footer></form>`;
  const requirements = Array.isArray(ai.requirements) ? ai.requirements : [];
  const conditions = Array.isArray(ai.conditions) ? ai.conditions : [];
  const summaryPanel = `<section class="stage-admin-ai-summary"><header><span>INTELIGÊNCIA DA ETAPA</span><h4>Requisitos e condições vigentes</h4></header><div><small>REQUISITOS</small>${requirements.length ? requirements.map((item: unknown) => `<p>${esc(item)}</p>`).join('') : '<p>Nenhum requisito persistido.</p>'}</div><div><small>CONDIÇÕES</small>${conditions.length ? conditions.map((item: unknown) => `<p>${esc(item)}</p>`).join('') : '<p>Nenhuma condição persistida.</p>'}</div><div><small>DESCRIÇÃO TÍPICA</small><p>${esc(ai.typicalDescription || 'Ainda não configurada.')}</p></div></section>`;
  const lines = (value: unknown): string => Array.isArray(value) ? value.join('\n') : '';
  const aiForm = `<form data-stage-admin-ai class="stage-admin-ai-editor"><header><div><span>REGRAS DA INTELIGÊNCIA</span><h4>Requisitos, condições e contexto</h4></div><small>Usado no planejamento e nas decisões da etapa</small></header><div class="stage-ai-core-grid"><label>Requisitos obrigatórios<textarea name="requirements" rows="5" placeholder="Uma regra por linha.">${esc(lines(ai.requirements))}</textarea></label><label>Condições de execução, liberação e bloqueio<textarea name="conditions" rows="5" placeholder="Uma condição por linha.">${esc(lines(ai.conditions))}</textarea></label></div><label>Descrição típica da execução<textarea name="typicalDescription" rows="3">${esc(ai.typicalDescription || '')}</textarea></label><label>Pistas para planejamento<textarea name="requestHints" rows="3">${esc(lines(ai.requestHints))}</textarea></label><label>Comprovações esperadas<textarea name="evidenceFocus" rows="3">${esc(lines(ai.evidenceFocus))}</textarea></label><label>Materiais e compras a observar<textarea name="procurementFocus" rows="3">${esc(lines(ai.procurementFocus))}</textarea></label><footer><span data-stage-admin-ai-status>${ai.updatedAt ? `Persistido em ${esc(new Date(ai.updatedAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR'))}.` : 'Ainda não persistido.'}</span><button type="submit">Salvar regras da IA</button></footer></form>`;
  return `<div class="stage-admin-kpis">${kpis.map(([label, value, note]) => `<article><small>${label}</small><strong>${esc(value)}</strong><span>${esc(note)}</span></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="stage-admin-overview-grid">${metadata}${summaryPanel}</div>${aiForm}`;
}

/** Render the legacy stage-administration workspace through the typed component owner. */
export function renderAtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceV1(input: { data: AtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceModelV1; tab: AtlasStageAdministrationTabV1 }): string {
  const esc = escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1;
  const tabs = atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.tabs;
  return `<section class="stage-admin-workspace" data-stage-admin-workspace><header class="stage-admin-head"><div><span>ADMINISTRAÇÃO DA ETAPA</span><h2>Histórico, situação e configuração operacional</h2><p>Compras, materiais, serviços, atividades, registros e regras que alimentam a inteligência da frente.</p></div><button type="button" data-stage-admin-refresh>Atualizar leitura</button></header><nav class="stage-admin-tabs">${tabs.map(({ key, label }) => `<button type="button" data-stage-admin-tab="${key}" class="${input.tab === key ? 'active' : ''}" aria-current="${input.tab === key ? 'page' : 'false'}">${label}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="stage-admin-content" data-stage-admin-content>${renderAtlasStageAdministrationContentV1(input.data, input.tab)}</div></section>`;
}

/** Bind workspace DOM events and hand typed actions back to the program owner. */
export function bindAtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceV1(input: {
  root: HTMLElement;
  onTab(tab: AtlasStageAdministrationTabV1): void;
  onRefresh(): void;
  onMetadataSubmit(values: AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1): Promise<string>;
  onRulesSubmit(values: AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1): Promise<string>;
}): void {
  input.root.addEventListener('click', event => {
    const target = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target : null;
    const tab = target?.closest<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-stage-admin-tab]')?.dataset.stageAdminTab;
    if (tab && atlasStageAdministrationPresentationV1.tabs.some(item => item.key === tab)) { input.onTab(tab as AtlasStageAdministrationTabV1); return; }
    if (target?.closest('[data-stage-admin-refresh]')) input.onRefresh();
  });
  input.root.addEventListener('submit', event => {
    const form = event.target instanceof HTMLFormElement ? event.target : null;
    if (!form) return;
    if (form.matches('[data-stage-admin-meta]')) submitAtlasStageAdministrationFormV1({
      event,
      form,
      statusSelector: '[data-stage-admin-meta-status]',
      pendingMessage: 'Salvando…',
      failureMessage: 'Falha ao salvar.',
      read: readAtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1,
      submit: input.onMetadataSubmit,
    });
    else if (form.matches('[data-stage-admin-ai]')) submitAtlasStageAdministrationFormV1({
      event,
      form,
      statusSelector: '[data-stage-admin-ai-status]',
      pendingMessage: 'Salvando regras da IA…',
      failureMessage: 'Falha ao salvar regras da IA.',
      read: readAtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1,
      submit: input.onRulesSubmit,
    });
  });
}

/** Ensure the existing dedicated stage form exposes its typed AI context inputs. */
export function ensureAtlasStageAdministrationContextFieldsV1(form: HTMLFormElement): void {
  if (!form.querySelector('[data-stage-ai-core]')) {
    const block = form.ownerDocument.createElement('div');
    block.className = 'stage-ai-core-grid';
    block.dataset.stageAiCore = 'true';
    block.innerHTML = '<label>Requisitos obrigatórios para a IA<textarea name="requirements" rows="4" placeholder="Uma regra por linha. Ex.: só liberar após medição validada."></textarea></label><label>Condições de execução, liberação e bloqueio<textarea name="conditions" rows="4" placeholder="Uma condição por linha. Ex.: bloquear se cobertura de materiais for menor que 80%."></textarea></label>';
    form.querySelector('label')?.insertAdjacentElement('beforebegin', block);
  }
}

/** Inject and hydrate the stage AI context fields in its existing dedicated form. */
export function hydrateAtlasStageAdministrationContextFormV1(form: HTMLFormElement, data: AtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceModelV1): void {
  ensureAtlasStageAdministrationContextFieldsV1(form);
  const ai = data.aiConfig || {}, execution = ai.executionProfile || {};
  const set = (name: string, value: unknown): void => { const field = form.elements.namedItem(name) as HTMLInputElement | HTMLTextAreaElement | HTMLSelectElement | null; if (field) field.value = value == null ? '' : String(value); };
  set('requirements', Array.isArray(ai.requirements) ? ai.requirements.join('\n') : '');
  set('conditions', Array.isArray(ai.conditions) ? ai.conditions.join('\n') : '');
  set('typicalDescription', ai.typicalDescription || (form.elements.namedItem('typicalDescription') as HTMLInputElement | HTMLTextAreaElement | null)?.value || '');
  set('requestHints', Array.isArray(ai.requestHints) ? ai.requestHints.join('\n') : '');
  set('evidenceFocus', Array.isArray(ai.evidenceFocus) ? ai.evidenceFocus.join('\n') : '');
  set('procurementFocus', Array.isArray(ai.procurementFocus) ? ai.procurementFocus.join('\n') : '');
  const targets = ai.notificationTargets || {};
  set('notifyOwner', Array.isArray(targets.owner) ? targets.owner.join(', ') : '');
  set('notifyAdmin', Array.isArray(targets.admin) ? targets.admin.join(', ') : '');
  set('notifyForeman', Array.isArray(targets.foreman) ? targets.foreman.join(', ') : '');
  const materials = atlasStageAdministrationRowsV1<Record<string, unknown>>(execution.materialsTable);
  const body = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-materials]');
  if (body && materials.length) body.innerHTML = materials.map((item: Record<string, unknown>) => `<tr data-stage-material-row><td><input name="materialName" value="${escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1(item.name)}"></td><td><input name="materialDescription" value="${escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1(item.description)}"></td><td><input name="materialQuantity" value="${escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1(item.quantity)}" inputmode="decimal"></td><td><input name="materialUnit" value="${escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1(item.unit)}"></td><td><input name="materialStatus" value="${escapeAtlasStageAdministrationHtmlV1(item.status || 'Planejado')}"></td></tr>`).join('');
  const status = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-context-status]');
  if (status) status.textContent = ai.updatedAt ? `Configuração persistida em ${new Date(ai.updatedAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR')}.` : 'Configure requisitos, condições e contexto operacional desta etapa.';
}

/** Keep the existing Gantt/canvas surfaces available under a collapsible secondary section. */
export function installAtlasStageAdministrationPlanningSecondaryV1(surface: HTMLElement, workspace: HTMLElement): void {
  if (!surface.classList.contains('stage-shell') || surface.querySelector('[data-stage-visual-details]')) return;
  const nodes = ['.stage-progress-overview', '.stage-utilities', '.stage-body'].map(selector => surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>(selector)).filter((node): node is HTMLElement => Boolean(node));
  if (!nodes.length) return;
  const details = surface.ownerDocument.createElement('details');
  details.className = 'stage-visual-details';
  details.dataset.stageVisualDetails = 'true';
  details.innerHTML = '<summary><span><b>Planejamento visual</b><small>Gantt, calendário, canvas relacional e superfície gráfica da etapa</small></span><em>Abrir</em></summary><div data-stage-visual-body></div>';
  workspace.insertAdjacentElement('afterend', details);
  const body = details.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-visual-body]');
  nodes.forEach(node => body?.append(node));
  details.addEventListener('toggle', () => { const label = details.querySelector<HTMLElement>('summary em'); if (label) label.textContent = details.open ? 'Fechar' : 'Abrir'; });
}

/** Update stage labels in the shell after a report refresh. */
export function updateAtlasStageAdministrationShellV1(surface: HTMLElement, data: AtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceModelV1): void {
  if (surface.classList.contains('stage-shell')) {
    surface.classList.add('stage-admin-primary-mode');
    const context = surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-view-context');
    if (context) {
      const title = context.querySelector<HTMLElement>('strong'); if (title) title.textContent = String(data.name || title.textContent || '');
      const summary = context.querySelector<HTMLElement>('small'); if (summary) summary.textContent = `${data.week || 'Sem referência'} · ${Number(data.progress) || 0}% · ${data.owner || 'A definir'}`;
    }
    return;
  }
  const head = surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.dedicated-head');
  if (!head) return;
  const progress = head.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-dedicated-progress'); if (progress) progress.textContent = `${Number(data.progress) || 0}%`;
  const summary = head.querySelector<HTMLElement>('p'); if (summary) summary.textContent = `${data.week || 'Sem referência'} · ${data.owner || 'A definir'} · ${data.status || 'planejado'} · acompanhamento operacional`;
}

export interface AtlasStageAdministrationViewControllerV1 {
  render(data: AtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceModelV1): void;
  setLoading(loading: boolean): void;
  showUnavailable(): void;
  dispose(): void;
}

export type AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1 = Readonly<Record<string, string>>;

export interface AtlasStageAdministrationMaterialDraftV1 {
  name: string;
  description: string;
  quantity: string;
  unit: string;
  status: string;
}

export interface AtlasStageAdministrationContextDraftV1 {
  values: AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1;
  contextKey: string;
  materialRows: AtlasStageAdministrationMaterialDraftV1[];
}

type AtlasStageAdministrationSubmitV1<T> = (draft: T) => Promise<string>;

function readAtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1(form: HTMLFormElement): AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1 {
  const entries = [...new FormData(form).entries()].filter((entry): entry is [string, string] => typeof entry[1] === 'string');
  return Object.freeze(Object.fromEntries(entries));
}

function readAtlasStageAdministrationContextDraftV1(form: HTMLFormElement): AtlasStageAdministrationContextDraftV1 {
  const materialRows = [...form.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-material-row]')].map(row => ({
    name: row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="materialName"]')?.value || '',
    description: row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="materialDescription"]')?.value || '',
    quantity: row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="materialQuantity"]')?.value || '',
    unit: row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="materialUnit"]')?.value || '',
    status: row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="materialStatus"]')?.value || '',
  })).filter(item => item.name || item.description || item.quantity);
  return Object.freeze({
    values: readAtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1(form),
    contextKey: form.dataset.stageContextForm || '',
    materialRows,
  });
}

function submitAtlasStageAdministrationFormV1<T>(input: {
  event: Event;
  form: HTMLFormElement;
  statusSelector: string;
  pendingMessage: string;
  failureMessage: string;
  read(form: HTMLFormElement): T;
  submit: AtlasStageAdministrationSubmitV1<T>;
}): void {
  input.event.preventDefault();
  const status = input.form.querySelector<HTMLElement>(input.statusSelector);
  if (status) status.textContent = input.pendingMessage;
  void input.submit(input.read(input.form)).then(message => {
    if (status) status.textContent = message;
  }).catch(error => {
    if (status) status.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : input.failureMessage;
  });
}

/** Own stage-admin view mounting, tabs, dedicated-form binding, and route observation. */
export function installAtlasStageAdministrationViewV1(input: {
  documentRef: Document;
  windowRef: Window & typeof globalThis;
  currentStageId(): number | null;
  subscribe(listener: () => void): () => unknown;
  onStageChanged(stageId: number | null): void;
  loadStage(stageId: number, force?: boolean): void;
  onContextSubmit(draft: AtlasStageAdministrationContextDraftV1): Promise<string>;
  onMetadataSubmit(values: AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1): Promise<string>;
  onRulesSubmit(values: AtlasStageAdministrationFormValuesV1): Promise<string>;
}): AtlasStageAdministrationViewControllerV1 {
  const {documentRef, windowRef} = input;
  let activeTab: AtlasStageAdministrationTabV1 = 'overview';
  let lastStageId: number | null = null;
  let stopped = false;
  const validTabs = new Set<AtlasStageAdministrationTabV1>(['overview', 'activities', 'purchases', 'materials', 'services', 'records', 'history']);
  const stageSurface = (): HTMLElement | null => documentRef.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-dedicated') || documentRef.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-shell');
  const overviewSurface = (surface: HTMLElement | null): boolean => Boolean(surface?.classList.contains('stage-shell'));

  const bindDedicatedContext = (surface: HTMLElement): void => {
    const form = surface.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-stage-context-form]');
    if (!form || form.dataset.stageAdministrationBound === 'true') return;
    ensureAtlasStageAdministrationContextFieldsV1(form);
    form.dataset.stageAdministrationBound = 'true';
    form.addEventListener('submit', event => submitAtlasStageAdministrationFormV1({
      event,
      form,
      statusSelector: '[data-stage-context-status]',
      pendingMessage: 'Persistindo requisitos e condições…',
      failureMessage: 'Falha ao salvar o contexto operacional.',
      read: readAtlasStageAdministrationContextDraftV1,
      submit: input.onContextSubmit,
    }));
  };

  const render = (data: AtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceModelV1): void => {
    const surface = stageSurface();
    if (!surface || Number(data.id) !== input.currentStageId()) return;
    if (surface.classList.contains('stage-dedicated')) {
      const form = surface.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-stage-context-form]');
      if (form) hydrateAtlasStageAdministrationContextFormV1(form, data);
    }
    const existing = surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-admin-workspace]');
    const holder = documentRef.createElement('div');
    holder.innerHTML = renderAtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceV1({data, tab: activeTab});
    const generated = holder.firstElementChild as HTMLElement | null;
    if (existing && generated) existing.replaceWith(generated);
    else if (generated && overviewSurface(surface)) {
      const anchor = surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-view-tabs') || surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-toolbar');
      anchor?.insertAdjacentElement('afterend', generated);
    } else if (generated) surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.dedicated-canvas')?.insertAdjacentElement('beforebegin', generated);
    const workspace = surface.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-admin-workspace]');
    if (!generated || !workspace) return;
    bindAtlasStageAdministrationWorkspaceV1({
      root: workspace,
      onTab: tab => {
        if (!validTabs.has(tab)) return;
        activeTab = tab;
        render(data);
      },
      onRefresh: () => input.loadStage(Number(data.id), true),
      onMetadataSubmit: input.onMetadataSubmit,
      onRulesSubmit: input.onRulesSubmit,
    });
    if (overviewSurface(surface)) installAtlasStageAdministrationPlanningSecondaryV1(surface, workspace);
    updateAtlasStageAdministrationShellV1(surface, data);
  };

  const showUnavailable = (): void => {
    const page = stageSurface();
    const form = page?.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-stage-context-form]');
    if (form) ensureAtlasStageAdministrationContextFieldsV1(form);
    if (!page || page.querySelector('[data-stage-admin-workspace]')) return;
    const fallback = documentRef.createElement('section');
    fallback.className = 'stage-admin-workspace stage-admin-offline';
    fallback.dataset.stageAdminWorkspace = '';
    fallback.innerHTML = '<header class="stage-admin-head"><div><span>ADMINISTRAÇÃO DA ETAPA</span><h2>Leitura persistente indisponível</h2><p>As rotas administrativas ainda não responderam; a página visual foi preservada abaixo.</p></div></header>';
    const overview = overviewSurface(page);
    const anchor = overview ? page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.stage-view-tabs') : page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.dedicated-canvas');
    anchor?.insertAdjacentElement(overview ? 'afterend' : 'beforebegin', fallback);
  };

  const enhance = (): void => {
    if (stopped) return;
    const surface = stageSurface();
    if (!surface) return;
    bindDedicatedContext(surface);
    const stageId = input.currentStageId();
    if (stageId !== lastStageId) {
      activeTab = 'overview';
      lastStageId = stageId;
      input.onStageChanged(stageId);
    }
    if (stageId && surface.dataset.stageAdminRequested !== String(stageId)) {
      surface.dataset.stageAdminRequested = String(stageId);
      input.loadStage(stageId);
    }
  };

  const observer = new windowRef.MutationObserver(enhance);
  observer.observe(documentRef.documentElement, {childList: true, subtree: true});
  const unsubscribe = input.subscribe(enhance);
  const onRefresh = (): void => {
    const stageId = input.currentStageId();
    if (stageId) input.loadStage(stageId, true);
  };
  windowRef.addEventListener('belavista:stage-admin-refresh', onRefresh);
  windowRef.queueMicrotask(enhance);

  return Object.freeze({
    render,
    setLoading(loading: boolean): void {
      const surface = stageSurface();
      if (loading) surface?.setAttribute('data-stage-admin-loading', 'true');
      else surface?.removeAttribute('data-stage-admin-loading');
    },
    showUnavailable,
    dispose(): void {
      stopped = true;
      observer.disconnect();
      unsubscribe();
      windowRef.removeEventListener('belavista:stage-admin-refresh', onRefresh);
      documentRef.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-stage-admin-loading]').forEach(surface => surface.removeAttribute('data-stage-admin-loading'));
    },
  });
}

